          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the dispute arises from a bus accident in France involving tires made by Goodyear Dunlop Tires Operations S.A. and related companies, whose only connection to North Carolina is the sale of a small fraction of their products in that state."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "abe93e958e2165c1451e147edfaefd3c7f5bdaf65d7003d09cd68da99586ea20",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-abe93e958e21-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the central legal question is whether the sale of a small fraction of a foreign defendant\u2019s products in a state gives that state general jurisdiction over the defendant\u2019s worldwide conduct."
      }
    ],
