        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the case questions whether a state can claim general jurisdiction over foreign manufacturers based only on the sale of a small fraction of their products in that state."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "abe93e958e2165c1451e147edfaefd3c7f5bdaf65d7003d09cd68da99586ea20",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-abe93e958e21-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 14,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "If such jurisdiction were allowed, the resulting jurisdictional reach could be disproportionate to the contacts the state has with the defendants."
      }
    ],
